# ── Curated repo: text, configs, web code and the new client are versioned.
# ── Legacy runtime binaries, database data, logs and bulk assets are not.
# ── (See knowledge.md for what lives where.)

# ── Java runtime / game server binaries ──
*.jar
*.dll
*.exe

MKO_Client/Assets/

# ── Binary game data tables (not hand-editable; see knowledge.md) ──
*.dat
*.jat
*.mm
*.db
*.psd
*.ttc


*.log
*.err

# ── OS / editor noise ──
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.lnk
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── New web client build output + deps ──
client/node_modules/
client/dist/
tools/bridge/node_modules/
# Ruffle selfhosted runtime (~30MB) staged from npm by sync:ruffle
client/public/ruffle/

# ── Python server bytecode (the SQLite db is covered by *.db above) ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Local dev credentials (never commit) ──
MKO_Client/config.json

# ── Local agent metadata ──
.freebuff/
/reference
.aider*
/reference
/output
